<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">1 BaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo lwotanga lwaPaulu Kuba Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 BaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Lwotanga lwaPaulu</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUBATESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo lwotanga kubaTesalonika lwakakwalwa noMpositoli Paulu (1 BaTesalonika 1:1). Yolu lungaba lukwalo lwotanga lwakakwalwa naPaulu lwakabigwa muwhalo jeBhayibhili. Akale lwaka kwalwa kungaba kwapinda makole angaba makumi mashanu ane limwempela Kristo azwalwa. Paulu wakabeli muKolinte paakakwala lukwalo yolu kugubungano lyeTesalonika. Lili igubungano lyaakabaamba mulwendo lulwe lwemishingo lwabili (Mishingo 17:1—10). Kunowhi muwhalo Lyemishingo kuwhi igubungano lyakabeshanganisa baJuda nabe chiGiliki banji.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu ajakatubula kugala muTesalonika munshaji ndefu mushule mokusungula igubungano, nokudalo wakatumija lukwalo yolu esungwaja banamati yoko. Lukwalo yolu luna misholo yenyaya minji akale nendayijo inoleba kululama kunokwelela kutiwa namaKristo. Paulu unosimisa kuzha kabili kwaKristo. Ateni banamati mugubungano lyokuTesalonika bakabedisisisa inyaya yeyi. Paulu wakashingisa kuzha kabili kwaKristo sokusungwaja kulalama bupenyu bunoshantisa Mwali (1 BaTesalonika 5:6-8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo unotanga lukwalo nokupa kumusa igubungano akale nokuboka Mwali kwabali (1 Tesalonika 1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova etobela nemishingo iye nenyaya yakabuzwa na Timoti kwaali (1 Tesalonika 2-3—3:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotobela nokupa indayijo yokuti maKristo banokwelela kulalama chini bekalingilila kuzha kwabili kwaJesu (1 BaTesalonika 4:1—5:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unokonya nokumusa igubungano akale ekumbila bose baiyimo mugubungano kuti bebale lukwalo yolu (BaTesalonika 5:16-28)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukwalo lwotanga lwaPaulo kubaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Imi naPaulu, Silivanosi naTimoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Kugubungano lyabaTesalonika kunaMwali Tate munaTezi Jesu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ngakube Chipiwo nolunyalalo.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupenyu nokudimbwa kwabaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Tinopa kuboka Mwali mazhuba ose pezhulu penu mwose timuleba wose nshaji muminamato yedu, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />tinomukumbuluka mbeli kwaMwali wedu, ndibo Tate, mishingo yenu yokudimbwa, kushinga kunova muludo, nokusungwala kolubimbo munaTezi Jesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Toziba, banakwaina banodikana naMwali, kuti iye wakamushala. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Nokuti iNdebo iMbuya yedu yakaswika kwamuli esimawhi chete, koga yakaswika nesimba, noMpepo uNchena, nokudimbwa kukulwana, akale munoziba kuti takatondeja kuti banhu bali chini tili namwi titila imwi. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Namwi mwakakwejejela isu naTezi, kojoba mwakabeli mukujijwa mwakatambula iWhi nolushanto, musungwajwa muMpepo uNchena, <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />kutila kuti chibe chibonelo kubavumili bose bokuMasedoniya nokuAkeya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Atoba kuwhi iWhi lyaTezi lyakatanga kupalalanywa kuvila kwamuli, likaswika kuMasedoniya nokuAkeya chete, koga kudimbwa kwenu kunaMwali kwakazhalilana kale, nokudalo azwichinoshakika kuti tilebe zwimwe. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Nokuti ibo ndibo banolebeleka nozwedu kuti mwakatitambula chini pakati penu akale kuti mwakalinga kunaMwali mutukulila zwimwali, kuti mushingile Mwali umpenyu wechokomende, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />akale kumilila Mwananhulumyana uwe eva kudenga, waakamusa mubafi, Jesu unotichija mubukali bukumuzha.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Mishingo yaPaulu muTesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Banakwaina imwi nokwenu, munoziba kuti kushanya kwedu kwamuli akujakaba madhana. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Kojoba takabayaba akale nokubhatwa zwinopisa inshoni kuFilipi, sokuziba kwenu, koga Mwali wakatipa moyo unsimu wokubhaunula iNdebo iMbuya iye kwamuli pakati pokunyenyejwa kukulwana. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Kusungwaja kwedu akujakava mukulunduka kana mushambwa kana mukuchenga. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Koga sezwa takashalwa naMwali tikabimbwa kuti tibhate unshingo weNdebo iMbuya, nokudalo atitobhaunula tishaka kushantisa unhu, koga kushantisa Mwali, iye unokweja mwoyo yedu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Nokuti atijakashingisa mawhi okushantisa, kana kusisa luchibi, Mwali ndiye unsumikiji. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />atijikumupyanga kukujwa nabanhu, kanamwi, kana aani azwe, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />kojoba takaba tili nesimba lyokumukakatila kuna zwakadai, sozwitili bapositoli baKristo. Koga takabeli banyolonyolo pakati penu sonzwele unolondota bana babe. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Nokumuda kasa kwedu, takadisisisa kuti tikobane namwi isiNdebo chete yaMwali koga nobupenyu bwedu nasubo, nokuti mwakaba mwaba banodikana kunasu. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Banakwaina muchinoyeya kushinga kwedu kukukutu, tishimbilika busiku namasikati, kutila kuti tisipe untolo panamwi, ponshaji tibhaunula iNdebo iMbuya yaMwali kwamuli.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Imwi mubasumikiji akale naMwali nayiye, bobuchena bwedu nobululami pesina chibi muntilo wedu kunamwi banodimbwa. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Nokuti mwoziba kuti umwe nomwe satate nabana babo, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />takamusungwaja chini, tikamunyalaja, akale tikamusungilija, mugale bupenyu bunodiwa naMwali iye unomushoba kubuShe bubwe nokulukujo.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Akale toboka Mwali nshaji wose pana yezwi, nokuti pamwakatambula iwhi lyaMwali lyamwakawha kunasu, amujakalitambula sewhi lyava kunhu koga mwakalitambula sobulili kasa sewhi lyaMwali limukushinga pakati penu, imwibavumili <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Imwi banakwaina mwakaba bakwejejeli bamakubungano aMwali munaKristo Jesu, iwo ayimo muJudiya, imwi mwakayangatiswa nabanhu beshango yenu sobubakayangatiswa ibo nabaJuda, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />belibo bakabulaya Tezi Jesu nabapolofita bakatitatila pazhe, besinoshantisa bo Mwali besinovumilana nabanhu bose, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />nokuti koneja kuti tilebeleke nabokuzhe kuti bechijwe. Yezwi bezwita misi yose kuti bezhaje luchinyo lwabo. Koga bukali bwaMwali bwabaswikila neebo pakujiba.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chido chaPaulu ChokuBashanyila Akale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Koga isu, patakabapambukana namwi banakwaina munshaji fupi mumbili, musi mumwoyo, takadisisa kasa nechido chikulwana kuti tibonane chiso nechiso. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Nokuti, takabeda kuzha kwamuli, imi Paulu, kanjinji koga Satani wakati binda. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Nokuti ngolupi lubimbo lwedu, nolushanto, nenhulu yokuzwikuja, mbeli kwaTezi Jesu pakubuya kukwe? Amutoba mwi na? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Chokomende imwi mulukujo nolushanto lwedu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Patakabona kuti atingazwitubule, takazwipila kuti tisale mushule yokuno kuAtene, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />takatuma mwanakwaina wedu Timoti unshingi nkwaina waMwali mundebo imbuya yaKristo, kuti emusimise akale emusungwaje mukudimbwa kwenu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />kutila kuti kusibe umwe wenu unonyajwa nenjabulo yeji. Imwi nokwenu munoziba kuti kuyangatiswa kwedu yoku kumo mumabambo aMwali. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Nokuti patakabeli namwi, takamubuja kale kuti tinooswikilwa nenjabulo, hezwo zwatikana sokuziba kwenu. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Nokuda kwezwi, pandakabona kuti andichinozwitubula kuzwimila, ndakontuma kuti ndibe noluzibo lwokudimbwa kwenu, nditya kuti posa unkweji wamukweja, akale wose nshingo wedu waluba usina nshingo.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Koga ngweno Timoti wezha eva kwamuli, etibuzila indebo imbuya yokudimbwa kwenu noludo lwenu, etibuja kuti mosogala mushantilwa nokutiyeya, akale mwazwimba kutibona nasubo tazwimba kumubona. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Nokudalo banakwaina mukusheta kwose nenjabulo, takanyalajwa namwi zwiva mukudimbwa kwenu, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />feno tolalama kana imwi mukama mukasima munaTezi. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Toomboka chini Mwali nokushanta kwatiwhile pezhulu penu, mbeli kwaMwali wedu? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Tinamata nesimba masikati nobusiku kutila kuti tibonane chiso nechiso namwi, kuti timupe zwisiimo mukudimbwa kwenu?.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Ngana ngweno Mwali wedu Tate bedu ibo, naTezi wedu Jesu betondeja inzila yokuzha kwamuli. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Ngana Tezi batakuti kupamijwe ludo lwenu luzhale lufushuke, mudanane akale nabanhu bose, somutinota kwamuli, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />kuti esimise myoyo yenu isina chibi mubuchena, mbeli kwaMwali Tate bedu, ponshaji wokuzha kwaTezi Jesu wedu eli nabachena babe bose.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Bupenyu BunoShantisa Mwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Kumapejelejo, banakwaina, tinomukumbila timubweta munaTezi Jesu, sobumwakalayijwa kuva kunasu kuti mokwelela kulalama chini akale nokushantisa Mwali. Somwamukumuta, ndilani mbeli muta alo. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Mwoziba chilayilo chatakamupa zwiva mumasimba aTezi Jesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Nokuti yoku kuda kwaMwali, kuti mucheneswe kuti muzwibhate mubusangu, <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Kuti umwe nomwe ezibe kubhata umbili uwe munzila ina buchena nokulemekeja, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />musi mukukubukilwa nokulakamila kuneshungu sezwabanota bokuzhe basinoziba Mwali, <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />kusibe noumwe unochinyila mwanakwaina uwe muna yechi, kana kubhatila mwanakwaina uwe nokuti Tezi ndiye unolanga pazwibi zwakadai, sezwa takamuchenjeja kale. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nokuti Mwali ajakatishoba kuti tibe neshambwa, koga kuti tibe mubuchena. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Nokudalo ani azwe usinotobeleja yezwi, aatobaalamba unhu, koga Mwali, unopa umpepo unchena kunamwi.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Ngweno penyaya joludo lwabanakwaina akutokwelela kuba noomwe unokwala kunamwi, nokuti imwi bomene mwakalayijwa naMwali kuti mudanane, <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />akale ndimo banakwaina moda bose bamomu Masedoniya. Koga tomusungwaja, banakwaina, mundilembeli muzwita kasa yezwi, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />kuba nechido chokugala mulunyalalo, musinani nozwabwamwe, mushinga namaboko enu, sobutakamulaya, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />kutila kuti mube banolemekejwa nabo pazhe, akale mube balozwimilila boga.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzha kwaTezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Banakwaina, atidi kuti mushayiwe luzibo, pezhulu paabo balele mulufu, kuti musiwhe kulwajilwa saabo bamwe basina lubimbo. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Nokuti tinodimbwa kuti Jesu wakafa akamuka akale, zwinooba alo nomuna Jesu. Mwali unoomusa yabo bakafila muna iye.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Toleba yezwi newhi lyaTezi, kuti isu bapenyu, bakasala kuswikila kuzha kwaTezi, atitoobatangila yabo bakafa, <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />nokuti Tezi emene unoobheluka eva kudenga pakushomeja kunootiwa newhi lyengilozi iwhulwana nopakulijwa kwewhamanda yaMwali, yaabo bakafa muna Kristo banootanga kumuka. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Kova isu bapenyu, basala tinoonyamulwa pamwempela naabo mumakole kunoshangamija Tezi mumpepo, nezwo toogala naTezi kusinopela. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Nokudalo nyalajanani mogamoga namawhi yaya.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Bambanyilani Kuzha kwaTezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Ngweno pane zwemisi nonshaji wegole, banakwaina azwitodikana kuti tikwale chimwe chinhu kwamuli. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Nokuti imwi mwoziba zwanana kuti izhuba lyaTezi linoozha sembava busiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Kana banhu beti, “Kuna lunyalalo nokugajikana,” pakalepo ndipo pakunotika kupalajika kunoswika kwabali sokulwaja kwemimba yonhukaji wabulochila, akale apana uchopujumuka. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Banakwaina imwi, amwimwo munhilima kuti yelyo izhuba lingamushamisa sembava, <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />nokuti imwi mwose mubana bechimuniko akale mubana bamasikati. Atitoba bobusiku kana benhilima. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Nokudalo tisilale sezwinota bamwe, koga tibhwazule, tibe balojikama. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Yabo banolala, banolala busiku, naabo banokolwa, banokolwa busiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Zwatili bamasikati, tigontame, timbale chitabilijo chope chifuba sechitabilijo chokudimbwa noludo, akale sechibimbo choluchijo ili inhulu yechitabilijo. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nokuti Mwali ajakatishala kuti tibemubukali, koga kuti tiwane luchijo munaTezi wedu Jesu Kristo, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />wakatifila, kutila kuti kojoba tikabhwazula kana tililele tingalalama tili naye. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Nokudalo sungwajanani, bakanani, somukuta kwenu.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayilo noKumusana Kopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Banakwaina tinomukumbila, kuti mulemese yabo banoshinga pakati penu, banomutungamilila munozwa Tezi akale bemulaya, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />nokubalemekeja kulwana muludo pezhulu pemishingo yabo. Gajikanani mulunyalalo muli mose.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Akale timubweta, banakwaina, kalalilani banojitaila, sungwajani balolengwala, bhanchani banabutela, ibani nomoyondefu kunaibo bose. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Lingani kuti kusibe noumwe wenu unobwilizila chibi nechibi koga, nshaji wose pyangani kutilana zwinhu zwibuyanana nokubanhu bose.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Shantani unshaji wose, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />namatani unshaji wose, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />pani kuboka kunaMwali muna zwose, nokuti yezwi ndizwo zwaanoda Mwali kuti muzwite munaKristo Jesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Musijime moto woMpepo, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />musishunde kupolofita, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />koga kwejani zwose, bhatisani pana chibuya, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />lekani zwibi zwose,<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />ngana Mwali wolunyalalo angomuchenesa mubulile, akale ngana umpepo wenu nemyoyo nombili wenu zwalondotwa pesina chibi ponshaji wokubuya kwaTezi Jesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Iye unomushoba ulobimbika, akale unoozwita.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Banakwaina, tinamatileni.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Mumuse bose banakwaina nokumyonta kuchena.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ndinomulaya munaTezi kuti lukwalo yolu lubalwe kubanakwaina bose.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Chipiwo jaTezi wedu Jesu Kristo ngajibe namwi.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>